        "text": "id: CultureMech:015858\nid_lineage_token: legacy:a28a3561406483ba3e4ab28c9bf546db9c26eb94ede85c4ac73085efcca61dc7\nname: methanosarcina_z_7115_medium\noriginal_name: METHANOSARCINA Z-7115 MEDIUM\ncategory: archaea\nmedium_type: DEFINED\ncomposition_type: DEFINED\nphysical_state: LIQUID\nph_value: 7.0\nmedia_term:\n  preferred_term: JCM Medium J1415\n  term:\n    id: jcm.grmd:1415\n    label: METHANOSARCINA Z-7115 MEDIUM\nnotes: 'Source: JCM | Link: https://www.jcm.riken.jp/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=1415'\ningredients:\n- preferred_term: NH4Cl\n  concentration:\n    value: '0.33'\n    unit: G_PER_L\n  term:\n    id: CHEBI:31206\n    label: ammonium chloride\n  mediaingredientmech_chebi_term:\n    id: CHEBI:31206\n    label: ammonium chloride\n- preferred_term: CaCl2·2H2O\n  concentration:\n    value: '0.16'\n    unit: G_PER_L\n  term:\n    id: CHEBI:86158\n    label: calcium chloride dihydrate\n  mediaingredientmech_chebi_term:\n    id: CHEBI:86158\n    label: calcium chloride dihydrate\n- preferred_term: KH2PO4\n  concentration:\n    value: '0.33'\n    unit: G_PER_L\n  term:\n    id: CHEBI:63036\n    label: potassium dihydrogen phosphate\n  mediaingredientmech_chebi_term:\n    id: CHEBI:63036\n    label: potassium dihydrogen phosphate\n- preferred_term: MgCl2·6H2O\n  concentration:\n    value: '0.33'\n    unit: G_PER_L\n  term:\n    id: CHEBI:86345\n    label: magnesium dichloride hexahydrate\n  mediaingredientmech_chebi_term:\n    id: CHEBI:86345\n    label: magnesium dichloride hexahydrate\n- preferred_term: Sodium acetate\n  concentration:\n    value: '0.2'\n    unit: G_PER_L\n  term:\n    id: CHEBI:32954\n    label: sodium acetate\n  mediaingredientmech_chebi_term:\n    id: CHEBI:32954\n    label: sodium acetate\n- preferred_term: Trace element solution (see Medium No. 899 )\n  concentration:\n    value: '1.0'\n    unit: ML_PER_L\n- preferred_term: Resazurin\n  concentration:\n    value: '0.5'\n    unit: MG_PER_L\n  term:\n    id: CHEBI:8806\n    label: Resazurin\n  mediaingredientmech_chebi_term:\n    id: CHEBI:8806\n    label: Resazurin\n- preferred_term: Distilled water\n  concentration:\n    value: '960.0'\n    unit: ML_PER_L\n  term:\n    id: CHEBI:15377\n    label: water\n  mediaingredientmech_chebi_term:\n    id: CHEBI:15377\n    label: water\n- preferred_term: 8% NaHCO3 soluiton*\n  concentration:\n    value: '25.0'\n    unit: ML_PER_L\n- preferred_term: Trace vitamins* (see Medium No. 197 )\n  concentration:\n    value: '10.0'\n    unit: ML_PER_L\n- preferred_term: 50% (v/v) Methanol\n  concentration:\n    value: '4.0'\n    unit: ML_PER_L\n- preferred_term: 5% L-Cysteine·HCl·H2O solution\n  concentration:\n    value: '5.0'\n    unit: ML_PER_L\n- preferred_term: 5% Na2S·9H2O solution\n  concentration:\n    value: '5.0'\n    unit: ML_PER_L\npreparation_steps:\n- step_number: 1\n  action: MIX\n  description: Mix components and adjust pH to 7.0.\n- step_number: 2\n  action: MIX\n  description: Autoclave the medium under a N2-CO2 (80:20 v/v) gas mixture.\n- step_number: 3\n  action: MIX\n  description: 'After cooling, aseptically and anaerobically, add the following solutions\n    (autoclaved or *filter-sterilized): Dispense the medium into culture vessels (e.g.,\n    20 ml of the medium in 60 ml serum bottles) under the same gas mixture and seal\n    with butyl rubber stoppers.'\napplications:\n- Microbial cultivation\ncuration_history:\n- timestamp: '2026-06-02T07:09:08.381209+00:00'\n  curator: jcm-grmd-import\n  action: Scraped from JCM GRMD database\n  notes: Direct import from JCM GRMD=1415. Ingredients captured verbatim; CHEBI/MediaIngredientMech\n    enrichment and category (bacterial/archaea) review are downstream steps.\n- timestamp: '2026-06-03T02:00:03.372111Z'\n  curator: chebi-enrichment\n  action: Added CHEBI ontology terms to ingredients\n  notes: Enriched using MicrobeMediaParam and MediaDive chemical mappings\n- timestamp: '2026-06-03T07:12:22.000000Z'\n  curator: mediaingredientmech-