        "text": "id: CultureMech:002739\nname: agc2_medium\noriginal_name: AGC2 MEDIUM\ncategory: bacterial\nmedium_type: COMPLEX\ncomposition_type: UNDEFINED\nphysical_state: LIQUID\nph_value: 1.8\nmedia_term:\n  preferred_term: JCM Medium J382\n  term:\n    id: mediadive.medium:J382\n    label: AGC2 MEDIUM\nnotes: 'Source: JCM | Link: https://www.jcm.riken.jp/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=382\n\n  Composition recovery source: https://togomedium.org/medium/M377 (TOGO snapshot of\n  JCM medium J382).'\ningredients:\n- preferred_term: yeast extract\n  concentration:\n    value: '0.5'\n    unit: G_PER_L\n  notes: 'Role: Nutrient source; Properties: Undefined component'\npreparation_steps:\n- step_number: 1\n  action: ADJUST_PH\n  description: Adjust pH to 3.0.\n- step_number: 2\n  action: AUTOCLAVE\n  description: Use Medium No. [92] with 44.2 g/L (final) FeSO4・7H2O, 5 ml 10 N H2SO4\n    and 0.5 g/L yeast extract. Dissolve ingredients except FeSO4・7H2O, yeast extract\n    and 10 N H2SO4 in 700 ml distilled water and autoclave. Separately dissolve FeSO4・7H2O\n    in 300 ml distilled water with 10 N H2SO4 and autoclave at 110C for 30 min. After\n    cooling, mix the both solutions. Before inoculation, add yeast extract from a\n    sterile stock solution (10%). Checkthe final pH to be 1.5 -- 2.0.\napplications:\n- Microbial cultivation\ncuration_history:\n- timestamp: '2026-01-26T17:53:16.458943Z'\n  curator: mediadive-import\n  action: Imported from MediaDive\n  notes: 'Source: JCM, ID: J382'\n- timestamp: '2026-02-03T11:26:54.748690'\n  curator: quality-tagger-v1.0\n  action: Added data quality flag\n  notes: Marked as incomplete_composition due to placeholder ingredients\n- timestamp: '2026-03-13T06:19:15.393992Z'\n  curator: culturemech-id-assigner-v1.0\n  action: Assigned CultureMech ID\n  notes: 'Assigned stable identifier: CultureMech:002739'\n- timestamp: '2026-03-17T19:45:28.785976+00:00'\n  curator: normalize_media_names_to_snake_case.py\n  action: NAME_NORMALIZED\