'0.714285714'\n      unit: G_PER_L\n    notes: 'Role: Mineral source; Properties: Simple component, Defined component,\n      Inorganic compound'\n  - preferred_term: K2HPO4\n    concentration:\n      value: '0.714285714'\n      unit: G_PER_L\n    notes: 'Role: Buffer; Properties: Defined component, Simple component, Inorganic\n      compound'\n    term:\n      id: CHEBI:131527\n      label: dipotassium hydrogen phosphate\n  - preferred_term: KCl\n    concentration:\n      value: '0.142857143'\n      unit: G_PER_L\n    notes: 'Role: Mineral source; Properties: Inorganic compound, Simple component,\n      Defined component'\n    term:\n      id: CHEBI:32588\n      label: potassium chloride\n  - preferred_term: (NH4)2SO4\n    concentration:\n      value: '4.285714286'\n      unit: G_PER_L\n    notes: 'Role: Nitrogen source; Properties: Simple component, Inorganic compound,\n      Defined component'\n    term:\n      id: CHEBI:62946\n      label: ammonium sulfate\n  - preferred_term: Ca(NO3)2\n    concentration:\n      value: '14.285714286'\n      unit: MG_PER_L\n    notes: 'Role: Mineral source; Properties: Defined component, Inorganic compound,\n      Simple component'\n    term:\n      id: CHEBI:64205\n      label: calcium nitrate\n  concentration:\n    value: '700'\n    unit: ML_PER_L\n  notes: Defined in TOGO medium M377. Local TOGO stock formulation is represented\n    as an inline composition; it is not flattened into final-medium ingredients.\n- preferred_term: Sol. 2\n  composition:\n  - preferred_term: 10 N H2SO4\n    concentration:\n      value: '16.666666667'\n      unit: ML_PER_L\n    notes: 'Role: Mineral source; Properties: Defined component, Solution, Inorganic\n      compound'\n  - preferred_term: Distilled water\n    concentration:\n      value: '1000'\n      unit: ML_PER_L\n    notes: 'Role: Solvating media; Properties: Simple component, Inorganic compound,\n      Defined component'\n    term:\n      id: CHEBI:15377\n      label: water\n  - preferred