        "sha256": "85ab5677d100cd93394fdd4d1fb12150412764bc850542fa3c24913c37162e8e",
        "text": "id: CultureMech:011626\npreferred_term: Main sol. 1113\nterm:\n  id: mediadive.solution:2234\n  label: Main sol. 1113\ncomposition:\n- preferred_term: Leptospira Medium Base EMJH\n  concentration:\n    value: '2.3'\n    unit: G_PER_L\n  term:\n    id: mediadive.compound:990\n    label: Leptospira Medium Base EMJH\n- preferred_term: Agarose\n  concentration:\n    value: '1.5'\n    unit: G_PER_L\n  term:\n    id: mediadive.compound:991\n    label: Agarose\n  chebi_term:\n    id: CHEBI:2511\n    label: agarose\n    confidence: 1.0\n    match_type: exact_match\n  evidence:\n  - reference: https://mediadive.dsmz.de/rest/solution/2234\n    supports: SUPPORT\n    snippet: |-\n      {\n                      \"recipe_order\": 2,\n                      \"compound\": \"Agarose\",\n                      \"compound_id\": 991,\n                      \"solution\": null,\n                      \"solution_id\": null,\n                      \"condition\": null,\n                      \"attribute\": null,\n                      \"amount\": 1.5,\n                      \"unit\": \"g\",\n                      \"g_l\": 1.5,\n                      \"mmol_l\": 2.37906,\n                      \"optional\": 0\n                  }\n    explanation: 'Concentration evidence for composition[1].concentration (Agarose)\n      in MediaDive solution 2234; locator=$.data.recipe[1] (compound_id=991). Provider\n      explicitly reports g_l=1.5. Arithmetic check: 1.5 g * 1 g/g / (1000 ml / 1000\n      ml per L) = 1.5 g/L, consistent with the reported value at its precision. Evidence\n      supports the provider-declared concentration within this solution, not a concentration\n      in a receiving medium or an independently measured final volume. Water addition\n      alone is not used to infer a final volume. Additional exact excerpt at $.data.volume:\n      \"volume\": 1000. Retrieved 2026-10-07T09:10:27.866317+00:00; response SHA256=4399b9acdca25145df883dbcc8dd3d7af20328b3223a01e8d1784f72cc4a4d67.'\n- preferred_term: Water\n  concentration:\n    value: '900'\n    unit: PERCENT_V_V\n  term:\n    id: mediadive.compound:754\n    label: Water\n  chebi_term:\n    id: CHEBI:15377\n    label: water\n    confidence: 1.0\n    match_type: exact_match\n- preferred_term: Leptospira Enrichment EMJH\n  concentration:\n    value: '100'\n    unit: PERCENT_V_V\n  term:\n    id: mediadive.compound:992\n    label: Leptospira Enrichment EMJH\npreparation_notes: Dissolve the agarose in water by boiling. Add the Leptospira base\n  and dissolve completely. Autoclave at 121°C for 15 min. Allow the medium to cool\n  to 50-55°C. Warm the Leptospira Enrichment to approximately 25°C and add to the\n  warm medium. Mix uniformly and dispense aseptically into sterile tubes as requested.\n  Final pH is 7.5 at 25°C.\ncuration_history:\n- timestamp: '2026-03-13T06:20:20.882485Z'\n  curator: culturemech-id-assigner-v1.0\n  action: Assigned CultureMech ID\n  notes: 'Assigned stable identifier: CultureMech:011626'\n- curator: schema-defaulter-v1.0\n  action: Applied schema defaults and normalizations\n  notes: Added placeholder ingredients for missing composition\n  timestamp: '2026-03-14T00:00:00+00:00'\n- timestamp: '2026-03-14T21:09:24.196715'\n  curator: quality-tagger-v1.0\n  action: Added data quality flag\n  notes: Marked as incomplete_composition due to placeholder ingredients\n- timestamp: '2026-04-04T17:50:04.049685'\n  curator: categorize_unknown_media\n  action: CATEGORIZED\n  changes: 'Set category to ''bacterial'' (was: MISSING)'\n  notes: 'Automated categorization (confidence: 0.30). No clear match, defaulting\n    to bacterial'\n- timestamp: '2026-05-16T09:03:47.639726+00:00'\n  curator: migrate_legacy_fields.py\n  action: MIGRATED_LEGACY_FIELDS\n  notes: curation_history.date->timestamp=1\n- timestamp: '2026-06-10T06:56:08.906649+00:00'\n  curator: kg-fallback-llm-curation-v1.0\n  action: LLM-curated low-confidence chebi_term (G25 Phase 3)\n  notes: '1 chebi_term(s)