raph\n  source: https://www.bacmedia.dsmz.de/medium/P10\n  notes: MediaDive public Medium P10 provides the current Modified BekiSolidMedium\n    agar recipe at pH 6.8-7.4. The official JSON lists an Elemento traza row in the\n    main solution with amount 0 and a blank unit, so the trace-element solution composition\n    is preserved with a variable addition volume rather than an invented ml/L dose.\n- timestamp: '2026-10-07T18:33:50.669117+00:00'\n  curator: codex\n  action: CORRECTED_PUBLIC_RECIPE_INPUT_BASES_WITH_SCOPED_EVIDENCE\n  notes: Source-backed input and evidence repairs only. Preserved stable ID, chemical\n    mappings, history, physical state, pH, preparation and variants. No inferred final\n    volume, percent basis, stock dilution or growth association.\n  source: https://mediadive.dsmz.de/medium/P10\n  changes: 'ingredients[0].concentration: {\"unit\": \"G_PER_L\", \"value\": \"25\"} -> {\"unit\":\n    \"G_PER_L\", \"value\": \"25\"} [evidence_only]; ingredients[1].concentration: {\"unit\":\n    \"G_PER_L\", \"value\": \"0.5\"} -> {\"unit\": \"G_PER_L\", \"value\": \"0.5\"} [evidence_only];\n    ingredients[2].concentration: {\"unit\": \"G_PER_L\", \"value\": \"0.2\"} -> {\"unit\":\n    \"G_PER_L\", \"value\": \"0.2\"} [evidence_only]; ingredients[3].concentration: {\"unit\":\n    \"G_PER_L\", \"value\": \"4\"} -> {\"unit\": \"G_PER_L\", \"value\": \"4\"} [evidence_only];\n    ingredients[4].concentration: {\"unit\": \"G_PER_L\", \"value\": \"0.5\"} -> {\"unit\":\n    \"G_PER_L\", \"value\": \"0.5\"} [evidence_only]; ingredients[5].concentration: {\"unit\":\n    \"G_PER_L\", \"value\": \"1\"} -> {\"unit\": \"G_PER_L\", \"value\": \"1\"} [evidence_only];\n    ingredients[6].concentration: {\"unit\": \"G_PER_L\", \"value\": \"15\"} -> {\"unit\": \"G_PER_L\",\n    \"value\": \"15\"} [evidence_only]; solutions[0].composition[0].concentration: {\"unit\":\n    \"G_PER_L\", \"value\": \"0.05\"} -> {\"unit\": \"G_PER_L\", \"value\": \"0.05\"} [evidence_only]