ider-declared concentration within this solution,\n      not a concentration in a receiving medium or an independently measured final\n      volume. Water addition alone is not used to infer a final volume. Additional\n      exact excerpt at $.data.volume: \"volume\": 1000. Retrieved 2026-10-07T09:11:43.213983+00:00;\n      response SHA256=dc003f4aa437c7cce49d761eb821b31b84fcbff89da5d3975521ad43f1260ca9.'\n- preferred_term: Distilled water\n  concentration:\n    value: '1000'\n    unit: PERCENT_V_V\n  term:\n    id: mediadive.compound:4\n    label: Distilled water\n  chebi_term:\n    id: CHEBI:15377\n    label: water\n    confidence: 0.7\n    match_type: corpus_consensus\npreparation_notes: \"Dispense the medium into the culture vessels. For small volumes\\\n  \\ serum bottles or Hungate tubes may be used. The gas phase to liquid ratio should\\\n  \\ be about 1:10. Use a gas phase containing air, 20-30% methane and autoclave at\\\n  \\ 121°C for 15 minutes. When the growth medium is cool the phosphate buffer is added.\\n\\\n  Autoclave at 121°C for 15 min.\\nAdd to the sterile medium from a filter sterilised\\\n  \\ phosphate buffer: \\nLiquid cultures should be grown with shaking.\\nFinal pH of\\\n  \\ the medium is 5.8.\"\ncuration_history:\n- timestamp: '2026-03-13T06:20:21.612926Z'\n  curator: culturemech-id-assigner-v1.0\n  action: Assigned CultureMech ID\n  notes: 'Assigned stable identifier: CultureMech:011734'\n- curator: schema-defaulter-v1.0\n  action: Applied schema defaults and normalizations\n  notes: Added placeholder ingredients for missing composition\n  timestamp: '2026-03-14T00:00:00+00:00'\n- timestamp: '2026-03-14T21:09:24.978840'\n  curator: quality-tagger-v1.0\n  action: Added data quality flag\n  notes: Marked as incomplete_composition due to placeholder ingredients\n- timestamp: '2026-04-04T17:50:14.163782'\n  curator: categorize_unknown_media\n  action: CATEGORIZED\n  changes: 'Set category to ''bacterial'' (was: MISSING)'\n  notes: 'Automat