        "sha256": "42ab49e7089a42ded0459d9934173827676715feb486f1d18d9da73e3db08e83",
        "text": "id: CultureMech:015441\nid_lineage_token: legacy:77967559e8e4b2f438705306f6903e4e1737ca819760c2dcd235d09fcd9c78d0\npreferred_term: Bold Trace Stock\nterm:\n  id: MediaIngredientMech:UNMAPPED_0065\n  label: Bold Trace Stock\ncomposition:\n- preferred_term: Sulfuric acid (concentrated)\n  concentration:\n    value: '10'\n    unit: ML_PER_L\n  term:\n    id: CHEBI:26836\n    label: sulfuric acid\n  mediaingredientmech_chebi_term:\n    id: CHEBI:26836\n    label: sulfuric acid\n  evidence:\n  - reference: https://utex.org/products/bbm-bold-trace-stock-solution\n    supports: SUPPORT\n    snippet: 10-mL\n    explanation: 'Supports composition[0].concentration only as this standalone stock''s\n      mass or supplied-liquid volume per liter. Directions; table row 1; component\n      printed as ''H2SO4 conc.''; Amount excerpt: ''10-mL''. Final-volume excerpt:\n      ''Bring total volume to 1 L''. Existing value and precision retained; no molecular-weight,\n      density, receiving-medium or working-dose conversion. '\n- preferred_term: Zinc sulfate heptahydrate\n  concentration:\n    value: '8.82'\n    unit: G_PER_L\n  term:\n    id: CHEBI:32312\n    label: zinc sulfate heptahydrate\n  evidence:\n  - reference: https://utex.org/products/bbm-bold-trace-stock-solution\n    supports: SUPPORT\n    snippet: 8.82 g\n    explanation: 'Supports composition[1].concentration only as this standalone stock''s\n      mass or supplied-liquid volume per liter. Directions; table row 2; component\n      printed as ''ZnSO4•7H2O''; Amount excerpt: ''8.82 g''. Final-volume excerpt:\n      ''Bring total volume to 1 L''. Existing value and precision retained; no molecular-weight,\n      density, receiving-medium or working-dose conversion. '\n- preferred_term: Manganese chloride tetrahydrate\n  concentration:\n    value: '1.44'\n    unit: G_PER_L\n  term:\n    id: CHEBI:86368\n    label: manganese(II) chloride tetrahydrate\n  mediaingredientmech_term:\n    id: MediaIngredientMech:001117\n  evidence:\n  - reference: https://utex.org/products/bbm-bold-trace-stock-solution\n    supports: PARTIAL\n    snippet: 1.44 g\n    explanation: Unresolved supplied-form claim at composition[2].concentration. Directions;\n      table row 3 prints 'MnCl•4H2O' with Amount excerpt '1.44 g' and volume excerpt\n      'Bring total volume to 1 L'. The record assigns manganese(II) chloride tetrahydrate\n      (MnCl2.4H2O), but the page omits the second chlorine. The database value and\n      identity are retained, not independently verified or silently repaired. No molarity\n      or working dilution is inferred.\n- preferred_term: Molybdenum trioxide\n  concentration:\n    value: '0.71'\n    unit: G_PER_L\n  term:\n    id: CHEBI:30627\n    label: molybdenum trioxide\n  mediaingredientmech_chebi_term:\n    id: CHEBI:30627\n    label: molybdenum trioxide\n  evidence:\n  - reference: https://utex.org/products/bbm-bold-trace-stock-solution\n    supports: SUPPORT\n    snippet: 0.71 g\n    explanation: 'Supports composition[3].concentration only as this standalone stock''s\n      mass or supplied-liquid volume per liter. Directions; table row 4; component\n      printed as ''MoO3''; Amount excerpt: ''0.71 g''. Final-volume excerpt: ''Bring\n      total volume to 1 L''. Existing value and precision retained; no molecular-weight,\n      density, receiving-medium or working-dose conversion. '\n- preferred_term: Copper sulfate pentahydrate\n  concentration:\n    value: '1.57'\n    unit: G_PER_L\n  term:\n    id: CHEBI:31440\n    label: copper(II) sulfate pentahydrate\n  mediaingredientmech_chebi_term:\n    id: CHEBI:31440\n    label: copper(II) sulfate pentahydrate\n  evidence:\n  - reference: https://utex.org/products/bbm-bold-trace-stock-solution\n    supports: SUPPORT\n    snippet: 1.57 g\n    explanation: 'Supports composition[4].concentration only as this standalone stock''s\n      mass or supplied-liquid volume per liter. Directions; table row 5; component\n      printed as ''CuSO4•5H2O''; Amount excerpt: ''1.57 g''. Final-volume excerpt:\n      ''Bring total volume to 1 L''. Existing value and precision retained; no molecular-weight,\n      density, receiving-medium or working-dose conversion. '\n- preferred_term: Cobalt nitrate hexahydrate\n  concentration:\n    value: '0.49'\n    unit: G_PER_L\n  term:\n    id: CHEBI:86214\n    label: cobalt dinitrate hexahydrate\n  mediaingredientmech_term:\n    id: MediaIngredientMech:001111\n  evidence:\n  - reference: https://utex.org/products/bbm-bold-trace-stock-solution\n    supports: SUPPORT\n    snippet: 0.49 g\n    explanation: 'Supports composition[5].concentration only as this standalone stock''s\n      mass or supplied-liquid volume per liter. Directions; table row 6; component\n      printed as ''Co(NO3)2•6H2O''; Amount excerpt: ''0.49 g''. Final-volume excerpt:\n      ''Bring total volume to 1 L''. Existing value and precision retained; no molecular-weight,\n      density, receiving-medium or working-dose conversion. '\nnotes: |\n  Trace metal stock solution for Bold Basal Medium (BBM) and related algae culture media.\n  Provides essential micronutrients (Zn, Mn, Mo, Cu, Co) for freshwater algae.\n\n  Preparation: Add components to approximately 900 mL deionized water in the order specified\n  while stirring continuously. Add H2SO4 FIRST to acidify the solution before adding metals.\n  This prevents precipitation. Bring to 1 L total volume.\n\n  Storage: Room temperature in darkness. The acidic pH keeps metals in solution.\n\n  Source discrepancy: the table's separately labeled concentration columns and its stock-solution footnote do not provide a consistent basis for the former micromolar stock summary. The structured amounts retain the explicit preparation amounts per final 1 L; no replacement molarity or working dilution is asserted. The manganese row prints MnCl.4H2O rather than the assigned MnCl2.4H2O; its supplied-form claim remains unresolved.\nsource_data:\n  origin: 