concentration\",\n    \"ingredient\": \"Molybdenum trioxide\", \"locator\": \"Directions; table row 4\", \"old\":\n    {\"unit\": \"G_PER_L\", \"value\": \"0.71\"}, \"proposed\": {\"unit\": \"G_PER_L\", \"value\":\n    \"0.71\"}, \"reference\": \"https://utex.org/products/bbm-bold-trace-stock-solution\",\n    \"snippet\": \"0.71 g\", \"source_component\": \"MoO3\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\"}, {\"action_taken\":\n    \"Added scoped SUPPORT evidence; numeric value retained\", \"basis_snippet\": \"Bring\n    total volume to 1 L\", \"calculation\": \"No numeric change proposed; preparation\n    amount per explicitly stated one-liter total stock volume.\", \"field\": \"composition[4].concentration\",\n    \"ingredient\": \"Copper sulfate pentahydrate\", \"locator\": \"Directions; table row\n    5\", \"old\": {\"unit\": \"G_PER_L\", \"value\": \"1.57\"}, \"proposed\": {\"unit\": \"G_PER_L\",\n    \"value\": \"1.57\"}, \"reference\": \"https://utex.org/products/bbm-bold-trace-stock-solution\",\n    \"snippet\": \"1.57 g\", \"source_component\": \"CuSO4\\u20225H2O\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\"},\n    {\"action_taken\": \"Added scoped SUPPORT evidence; numeric value retained\", \"basis_snippet\":\n    \"Bring total volume to 1 L\", \"calculation\": \"No numeric change proposed; preparation\n    amount per explicitly stated one-liter total stock volume.\", \"field\": \"composition[5].concentration\",\n    \"ingredient\": \"Cobalt nitrate hexahydrate\", \"locator\": \"Directions; table row\n    6\", \"old\": {\"unit\": \"G_PER_L\", \"value\": \"0.49\"}, \"proposed\": {\"unit\": \"G_PER_L\",\n    \"value\": \"0.49\"}, \"reference\": \"https://utex.org/products/bbm-bold-trace-stock-solution\",\n    \"snippet\": \"0.49 g\", \"source_component\": \"Co(NO3)2\\u20226H2O\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\"}],\n    \"notes\": {\"new\": \"Trace metal stock solution for Bold Basal Medium (BBM) and related\n    algae culture media.\\nProvides essential micronutrients (Zn, Mn, Mo, Cu, Co) for\n    freshwater algae.\\n\\nPreparation: Add components to approximately 900 mL deionized\n    water in the order specified\\nwhile stirring continuously. Add H2SO4 FIRST to\n    acidify the solution before adding metals.\\nThis prevents precipitation. Bring\n    to 1 L total volume.\\n\\nStorage: Room temperature in darkness. The acidic pH keeps\n    metals in solution.\\n\\nSource discrepancy: the table''s separately labeled concentration\n    columns and its stock-solution footnote do not provide a consistent basis for\n    the former micromolar stock summary. The structured amounts retain the explicit\n    preparation amounts per final 1 L; no replacement molarity or working dilution\n    is asserted. The manganese row prints MnCl.4H2O rather than the assigned MnCl2.4H2O;\n    its supplied-form claim remains unresolved.\\n\", \"old\": \"Trace metal stock solution\n    for Bold Basal Medium (BBM) and related algae culture media.\\nProvides essential\n    micronutrients (Zn, Mn, Mo, Cu, Co) for freshwater algae.\\n\\nPreparation: Add\n    components to approximately 900 mL deionized water in the order specified\\nwhile\n    stirring continuously. Add H2SO4 FIRST to acidify the solution before adding metals.\\nThis\n    prevents precipitation. Bring to 1 L total volume.\\n\\nStorage: Room temperature\n    in darkness. The acidic pH keeps metals in solution.\\n\\nFinal stock concentrations:\n    ZnSO4\\u00b77H2O (1.50 \\u00b5M), MnCl2\\u00b74H2O (0.36 \\u00b5M),\\nMoO3 (0.26 \\u00b5M),\n    CuSO4\\u00b75H2O (0.31 \\u00b5M), Co(NO3)2\\u00b76H2O (0.084 \\u00b5M)\\n\", \"snippet\":\n    \"Final concentration listed is for the stock solution.\"}, \"references\": {\"added_fields\":\n    [\"title\", \"notes\"], \"reference\": \"https://utex.org/products/bbm-bold-trace-stock-solution\"}}'\nreferences:\n- reference: https://utex.org/products/bbm-bold-trace-stock-solution\n  title: BBM Bold Trace Stock Solution Recipe\n  notes: source_type=culture_collection_page; discovery_mode=existing_record_reference;\n    accessed_on=2026-10-10; publisher=UTEX Culture Collection of Algae; locator=Directions\n    and formulation table where present. No named author, publication year or DOI\n    established. Amount and final-volume statements are reviewed separately from conflicting\n    concentration annotations; see scoped evidence.\n- reference: UTEX:bbm-bold-trace-stock-solution\n- reference: MediaIngredientMech:UNMAPPED_0065\n- reference: https://cccryo.fraunhofer.de/sources/files/medien/BBM.pdf\ncategory: bacterial\nevidence:\n- reference: https://utex.org/products/bbm-bold-trace-stock-solution\n  supports: SUPPORT\n  snippet: Final concentration listed is for the stock solution.\n  explanation: Supports the source-discrepancy disposition in notes, not the numeric\n    concentration columns. Directions state 'Bring total volume to 1 L'. For example,\n    the zinc Amount cell is '8.82 g' but its Stock Solution Concentration cell is\n    '0.44 mg/L'; these are not equivalent for that volume. The unverified micromolar\n    summary is replaced by this explicit conflict; no replacement molarity, density\n    calculation or receiving-medium dose is inferred.\n"
